<title>UK: Alliance &amp; Leicester '96 profit up 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Alliance &amp; Leicester '96 profit up 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Net interest receivable 643.8		 vs 582.0</p>
<p> Bad debt provision	19.5		  vs 2.7</p>
<p> Operating profit	  305.6		 vs 327.5</p>
<p> Pretax			305.6		 vs 287.8</p>
<p> Total income		1,077.2	     vs 1.035.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Alliance &amp; Leicester Building Society.</p>
